which the society in which it

00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:32.180
is embedded create
the themes within it.

00:36:32.180 --> 00:36:33.680
Like major things
that are in Madame

00:36:33.680 --> 00:36:36.080
Ovary is like centered
on this one woman who

00:36:36.080 --> 00:36:37.970
is like married in the
countryside of France

00:36:37.970 --> 00:36:39.950
back in like the 1900s or 1800s.

00:36:39.950 --> 00:36:43.090
And she gets really depressed
