00:36:52.030 --> 00:36:57.020
And like dissecting both
that cultural phenomenon

00:36:57.020 --> 00:37:02.380
and like examining how that
may play out in today's terms

00:37:02.380 --> 00:37:05.234
with different
patterns in society.

00:37:05.234 --> 00:37:06.118
